---
---
<section class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#161b28] transition-colors duration-300">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl">
    <div class="text-center md:text-left mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-4 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">No despachamos certificados. <br class="hidden lg:block"/> <span class="text-constival-mint">Construimos arquitectura legal acelerada.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-0 border border-constival-navy/10 dark:border-white/5">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-constival-navy/10 dark:border-white/5 group hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-[#15245a] transition-colors relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 mb-5 sm:mb-6 text-constival-mint">
             <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zm-2 15l-5-5 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l7.59-7.59L19 8l-9 9z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-3 sm:mb-4 pr-4">De la Confusión a la Claridad Ejecutable</h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans text-base sm:text-lg mb-8 sm:mb-10">Decodificamos estatutos complejos y los convertimos en paneles de control 100% digitales. Elimina el riesgo operativo con procesos accionables.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto">
          <a href="#configurador" class="font-sans font-bold text-constival-mint uppercase text-sm tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">Ver cómo simplificamos &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-constival-mint group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-constival-navy/10 dark:border-white/5 group hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-[#15245a] transition-colors relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 mb-5 sm:mb-6 text-constival-blue dark:text-constival-mint">
             <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-3 sm:mb-4 pr-4">Control Total de Costos y Plazos</h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans text-base sm:text-lg mb-8 sm:mb-10">Cotizaciones blindadas y publicadas. Cero costos ocultos ni facturas sorpresa. Lo que ves en tu proyección inicial, es tu inversión final.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto">
          <a href="#precios" class="font-sans font-bold text-constival-blue dark:text-constival-mint uppercase text-sm tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">Explorar honorarios fijos &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-constival-blue dark:bg-constival-mint group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500"></div>
      </div>
      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="p-8 sm:p-10 bg-white dark:bg-constival-deep group hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-[#15245a] transition-colors relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-full">
        <div>
          <div class="w-10 h-10 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 mb-5 sm:mb-6 text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint">
             <svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1L3 5v6c0 5.55 3.84 10.74 9 12 5.16-1.26 9-6.45 9-12V5l-9-4zm-2 16l-4-4 1.41-1.41L10 14.17l6.59-6.59L18 9l-8 8z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-3 sm:mb-4 pr-4">5 Capas de Protección Preventiva</h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/80 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans text-base sm:text-lg mb-8 sm:mb-10">Prevenir un quiebre interno es más eficiente que reaccionar ante él. Estructuramos defensas que evitan parálisis comerciales y disputas entre socios.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto">
          <a href="#configurador" class="font-sans font-bold text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint uppercase text-sm tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:translate-x-2 transition-transform">Evaluar tu riesgo actual &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-1 w-0 bg-constival-teal dark:bg-constival-mint group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
